<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1437353505"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:08.173"><div begin="13.678" end="43.906" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.678" end="15.768" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.678" end="15.168">那就等着沦陷</span><span begin="15.168" end="15.768">吧</span></p><p begin="17.565" end="19.734" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.565" end="19.167">如果爱情真伟</span><span begin="19.167" end="19.734">大</span></p><p begin="21.567" end="23.865" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.567" end="23.155">我有什么好挣</span><span begin="23.155" end="23.865">扎</span></p><p begin="25.576" end="27.769" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.576" end="27.129">难道我比别人</span><span begin="27.129" end="27.769">差</span></p><p begin="29.317" end="31.946" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.317" end="29.586">是</span><span begin="29.586" end="31.194">谁要周末待在</span><span begin="31.194" end="31.946">家</span></p><p begin="33.607" end="36.059" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.607" end="35.154">对着电视爆米</span><span begin="35.154" end="36.059">花</span></p><p begin="37.595" end="40.092" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.595" end="39.207">想起你说的情</span><span begin="39.207" end="40.092">话</span></p><p begin="41.608" end="43.906" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.608" end="43.139">哭得眼泪哗啦</span><span begin="43.139" end="43.906">啦</span></p></div><div begin="45.571" end="1:00.789" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="45.571" end="49.433" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.571" end="47.118">十个男人 七个</span><span begin="47.118" end="47.462">傻</span> <span begin="47.672" end="48.191">八个</span><span begin="48.191" end="48.449">呆</span> <span begin="48.630" end="49.176">九个</span><span begin="49.176" end="49.433">坏</span></p><p begin="49.633" end="53.461" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.633" end="51.164">还有一个人人</span><span begin="51.164" end="51.461">爱</span> <span begin="51.670" end=